{"availability":"available","full":"Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness","name":"awesome-deepseek-harness","description":"A curated list of plugins, skills, MCP servers, patch/profile layers, orchestrators & UIs for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Visualization · PPT · Coding · Agents · Loops (auto-research) and more. #dsh","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":362,"forks":188,"created":"2026-08-13T13:54:05Z","updated":"2026-10-06T09:00:53Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["agent","awesome-list","deepseek","dsh","llm","mcp","plugins","typescript"],"demo":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FK4k6WEKe","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:31.631Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:31.631Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:31.631Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:58.287Z","stars":360,"forks":186},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:08.922Z","stars":360,"forks":186},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:09:31.631Z","stars":362,"forks":188}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A curated list of plugins, skills, MCP servers, patch/profile layers, orchestrators, aggregators & UIs for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — DeepSeek's official agent runtime built around the idea Model + Harness = Agent.","DeepSeek Harness (\"DSH\") is DeepSeek's agent runtime / harness layer — the \"hands\" that turn the model's reasoning into real actions (context management, tool-call orchestration, execution sandbox, feedback loop, session persistence). Its defining feature is an open plugin ecosystem: the community contributes plugins, skills, MCP servers, orchestrators, aggregators, and UIs.","Tip for authors: DeepSeek asks plugin repositories to carry the #dsh GitHub topic so they can be discovered. Add it to your repo, then open a PR here."],"features":["ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI — Claude-Code-style full-screen terminal UI for DSH: pixel-whale top bar, live work-status line, streaming thoughts, double-Esc rollback, context progress bar + TPS gauge. ⭐3689 · Team pick…","omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar — Open sidebar foundation: third-party tab registration plus built-in file rendering/editing, terminal, side chat, Git, and sub-agent pages. ⭐3842 · Team pick 2026-09-27 · post","JackZo400/dsh-voice-transcribe — Local speech-to-text for dsh: SILK decoding + SenseVoice (sherpa-onnx int8), no API cost, about 0.1 s per clip.","leolee9086/SACsearch — Multi-engine meta-search plugin for DeepSeek Harness: roughly 200 API-key-free search engines, zero runtime dependencies.","qujinting/dsh-web-search-clinepass — DSH plugin (DeepSeek Harness): a websearch provider that searches with the session's selected model via gateway-native search tools, replacing the built-in DeepSeek-only provider."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"74775ee99f5d3428721d9afd128ead7773fd7dc555b0a15e867a22353fad1505","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T09:13:31.660Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:13:31.660Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A curated list of plugins, skills, MCP servers, patch/profile layers, orchestrators, aggregators & UIs for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — DeepSeek's official agent runtime built around the idea Model + Harness = Agent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"keenableai/dsh-keenable — Keenable web search and page fetch for DeepSeek Harness, no API key needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"RafaGonzalezDev/dsh-codex-oauth — DeepSeek Harness plugin that connects a ChatGPT plan through Sign in with ChatGPT and the official OpenAI Responses API.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"hongbaiqi/dsh-model-account-login — Persistent DSH model-account authorization UI for ChatGPT, Claude, and other llm-pi-ai login flows.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"AnkoCD/dsh-server-deployment — DeepSeek Harness multi-user server deployment: login portal, per-user isolated instances with OS-level isolation, independent API keys, and a delivery-file drawer; file access runs through a privilege-dropping sudo helper (fixes issue #1 TOCTOU).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"wjun19/dsh-trae-connect — Trae subscription model provider for DeepSeek Harness: web OAuth login, custom SSE translation, model allowlist, and a credits dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"orrinzeng/dsh-cursor-subscription — Log directly into your Cursor account within DeepSeek Harness and use your Cursor subscription — no API Key required, and no dependency on Cursor IDE or Cursor CLI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"74775ee99f5d3428721d9afd128ead7773fd7dc555b0a15e867a22353fad1505","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:13:31.667Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T09:00:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T09:13:31.693Z","hash":"74775ee99f5d3428721d9afd128ead7773fd7dc555b0a15e867a22353fad1505","originalBytes":1402296,"storedBytes":1402296,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["deepseek","harness","dsh","plugin","web","agent","session","desktop","harness.","mod